Use Cliffco's [Payment Estimator](https://www.cliffcomortgage.com/) to calculate your full monthly payment on any target property, then use that number to estimate the reserve floor you'll need to clear. If you're planning to grow a portfolio over the next several years, the [Budget Builder](https://www.cliffcomortgage.com/) can help you model how your reserve requirements grow as you add properties so you're never caught undercapitalized mid-deal.

